  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1408.02 Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1408.02 Procedures.\n\n(a) Any applicant or recipient who is or would be directly and adversely affected by the strict application of a rule in Env-Dw 1400 may request a waiver thereof from the department.\n\n(b) Each request for a waiver shall be filed in writing by the authorized representative of the applicant or recipient, as applicable.\n\n(c) Each request for a waiver shall include the information specified in Env-Dw 1408.03 and be signed as required by Env-Dw 1408.04.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
